title: March 8 Boston Stop | Xiaoqing Liu Invites You to Celebrate a Radiant Goddess Day
time: 03/08/2025, Saturday
address: Henderson House, 99 Westcliff Road, Weston, MA

summary:
Attention, ladies! AMEE’S MEDICAL SPA, Global Star Foundation, Asian American Alliance, Asian American Wellness and Beauty Association (AAWBA), and American Weston Academy (AWA) have joined forces to present an exclusive grand event for women — “A Radiant Evening with Xiaoqing Liu” on March 8, set to unfold romantically in Boston!

description:

[Event Highlights]
On this special day of March 8, 2025, a star-studded gala dinner awaits you at the historic Henderson House in Boston. Here, you will not only enjoy exquisite cuisine but also have the opportunity to listen to Xiaoqing Liu share her life wisdom up close, interact with her personally, and deeply appreciate the resilience and strength behind her legendary journey.

During the event, Xiaoqing Liu will showcase a live calligraphy performance, and her artworks will be auctioned on-site. Bring home a true artistic treasure and immerse yourself in a rich cultural atmosphere!

And the surprises don't stop there! A live lucky draw with fantastic prizes will keep your fortune flowing. Furthermore, a limited quantity of her autographed autobiography, Not Afraid to Start Over Again, will be available on a first-come, first-served basis—a true collector's item!

